    {
      "key": "091e9fc",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "Descubriste los puentes y las barcas del Sena. Los puentes te permiten cruzar el río que atraviesa París: el Sena.",
      "sourceEnText": "You discovered the bridges and boats of the Seine. The bridges allow you to cross the river that flows through Paris: the Seine.",
